    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505">

                <pb facs="0595" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg511"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Sir M. H. Herbert to
                        Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Newport</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-06-12"><hi rendition="#italic">June 12,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>His Majesty’s Government take exception to condition laid down in your note of
                    June 4, and strongly support application for extension of time. I am sending
                    note by post, which should reach you Saturday morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
